h F, OhAinle M. 2020. HIV-CRISPR: a CRISPR/Cas9 screening method to identify genes affecting HIV replication. Bio Protoc 10:e3614. doi: 10.21769/BioProtoc.3614.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.21769/BioProtoc.3614</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC7842688</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">33659577</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hart T, Tong AHY, Chan K, Van Leeuwen J, Seetharaman A, Aregger M, Chandrashekhar M, Hustedt N, Seth S, Noonan A, Habsid A, Sizova O, Nedyalkova L, Climie R, Tworzyanski L, Lawson K, Sartori MA, Alibeh S, Tieu D, Masud S, Mero P, Weiss A, Brown KR, Usaj M, Billmann M, Rahman M, Constanzo M, Myers CL, Andrews BJ, Boone C, Durocher D, Moffat J. 2017. Evaluation and design of genome-wide CRISPR/SpCas9 knockout screens. G3 (Bethesda) 7:2719&#8211;2727. doi: 10.1534/g3.117.041277.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1534/g3.117.041277</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5555476</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">28655737</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang B, Wang M, Zhang W, Xiao T, Chen CH, Wu A, Wu F, Traugh N, Wang X, Li Z, Mei S, Cui Y, Shi S, Lipp JJ, Hinterndorfer M, Zuber J, Brown M, Li W, Liu XS. 2019. Integrative analysis of pooled CRISPR genetic screens using MAGeCKFlute. Nat Protoc 14:756&#8211;780. doi: 10.1038/s41596-018-0113-7.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41596-018-0113-7</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC6862721</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">30710114</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Li W, Xu H, Xiao T, Cong L, Love MI, Zhang F, Irizarry RA, Liu JS, Brown M, Liu XS. 2014. MAGeCK enables robust identification of essential genes from genome-scale CRISPR/Cas9 knockout screens. Genome Biol 15:554. doi: 10.1186/s13059-014-0554-4.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1186/s13059-014-0554-4</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4290824</ArticleId><Arti